  "raw_label": "appellant_lost",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Rev.Fr.R.V.Thomas vs The District Collector on 10 April, 2024 Author: S.M.Subramaniam Bench: S.M.Subramaniam W. In The High Court Of Judicature At Madras Dated : 10.04.2024 Coram : The Honourable Mr. Justice S.M.Subramaniam W.P. No.10020 of 2024 and W.M.P.No.11032, 11033 & 11034 of 2024 Rev.Fr.R.V.Thomas . The District Collector, Kanchipuram District, Kancheepuram 631 501. 2. The District Social Welfare Officer, District Social Welfare, Kancheepuram. 3. The District Differently abled Welfare Officer, O/o. The District Differently abled welfare, Collectorate Campus, Kancheepuram 631 501. .. Prayer: Writ Petition is filed under Article 226 of Constitution of I issuance of writ of Certiorarified Mandamus, to call for the records to the impugned notice issued by the 2nd r Na.Ka.No.102/A1/2019 dated 26.03.2024 and quash the same as illegal, consequently direct the 2nd respondent not to interfere in the peace operation of the petitioner's hospice. Page No.1 of 7 https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis W. For Petitioner : Mr.R.Prabhakaran Rev.Fr.R.V.Thomas vs The District Collector on 10 April, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/135707283/ 1 For R1 to R3 : Mr.N.Naveenkumar Government Advocate ORDER The notice issued by the District Social Welfare Officer, Kancheepuram, in Memorandum dated 26.03.2024 is under challenge in the present writ proceedings.",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": "2. The petitioner states that he is the Managing Trustee of St.Joseph Hospice, for dying destitute established in the year 2011. The petitioner states that the purpose of association is to cater the needs of the people, who all are on the verge of the death. The petitioner states that by collecting donations from the public, he is running the organization and foreign funds are also received by the petitioner. 3. The memo impugned issued by the 2nd respondent is challenged on the ground that the petitioner is maintaining the House by following the requirements as contemplated under the Senior Citizen Act. The Government https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis is not providing adequate facility to the Senior Citizen, who all are on the verge of the death of their life. Therefore, such private organizations are contributing for the welfare of Senior Citizen."
  },
